From: Thorch contributors
Subject: [PATCH] input: qcom-haptics: update __assign_str invocation

The tracing API derives the source expression recorded by __string() and now
accepts only the destination field in __assign_str(). Update the downstream
Qualcomm haptics tracepoint so it builds when FTRACE is enabled for sched_ext.
---
 include/trace/events/qcom_haptics.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/include/trace/events/qcom_haptics.h
+++ b/include/trace/events/qcom_haptics.h
@@ -84,7 +84,7 @@ TRACE_EVENT(qcom_haptics_status,
 	),
 
 	TP_fast_assign(
-		__assign_str(id_name, name);
+		__assign_str(id_name);
 		__entry->msb = msb;
 		__entry->lsb = lsb;
 	),
